cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use YUCLAW's evidence layer, dataset, or EvidenceBench, please cite it as below."
title: "YUCLAW: The Open Evidence Layer for Financial AI"
authors:
  - name: "The YUCLAW Team"
version: 5.3.0
date-released: 2026-08-05
url: "https://yuclaw.ca"
repository-code: "https://github.com/YuClawLab/yuclaw-brain"
license: Apache-2.0
keywords:
  - financial evidence
  - SEC filings
  - groundedness benchmark
  - point-in-time data
notes: >-
  Research and education only — not investment advice. Signal labels are
  research classifications, not buy/sell recommendations. Dataset snapshots
  are tagged weekly (dataset-YYYY-MM-DD); each EvidenceBench release prints
  its item-set hash. Event-level citations use event IDs resolvable in the
  published packets.
